{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2e2dc62062258b67","name":"Extreme Heat or Cold","source":{"id":"source:reference-2e2dc62062258b67","title":"Extreme Heat or Cold","revision":18165,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:41:46Z","sha256":"0e959fc03f46540540d972e16137357dd258a90ba0d76c0a21ff66550a009684","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18165","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Extreme%20Heat%20or%20Cold&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2e2dc62062258b67","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Extreme Heat or Cold can punish those who are unprepared for it."]}," \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Extreme Heat or Cold Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A creature is exposed to Extreme Heat or Cold.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +6 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6 (-1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},"; Half Damage on Miss)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Hourly, as long as the target remains exposed to Extreme Heat or Cold.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," A creature that has taken damage from Extreme Heat or Cold cannot regain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or move up the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," until it spends at least 1 hour in a normal environment. Heavy clothing or armor provides a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," to resist Extreme Cold, but imposes a -5 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," to resist Extreme Heat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Extreme Heat or Cold that would be sufficient to harm or kill a creature or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," might not affect ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," and other machines, since most are designed to function under extreme conditions. However, in some situations, the weather on a planet might be so severe that it interferes with mechanical systems. In these cases, Gamemasters can use the following rules to represent the effects of Extreme Temperatures on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},". These rules should not be applied to creatures or Droids, which are covered above.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each minute a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," operates in Extreme Heat or Cold, make an attack roll (1d20+10) against the Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". If the attack succeeds, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," moves -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," can be removed only if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," receives ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repairs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repairs"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
